isation screen, click "Allow" to grant the plugin permission to send emails on your behalf.','Gmail authorization has not been completed.'=>'Gmail authorisation has not been completed.','The Google authorization code has already been used.'=>'The Google authorisation code has already been used.','As a temporary workaround, you can downgrade to PHP 7.3 on your server.'=>'As a temporary workaround, you can downgrade to PHP 7.3 on your server.','Contact your web hosting provider and inform them you are having issues with the libpcre2 library on PHP 7.4. They should be able to resolve this.'=>'Contact your web hosting provider and inform them you are having issues with the libpcre2 library on PHP 7.4. They should be able to resolve this.','Your server is running PHP 7.4.x with an outdated libpcre2 library (version 10.32 or earlier) that fails email address validation.'=>'Your server is running PHP 7.4.x with an outdated libpcre2 library (version 10.32 or earlier) that fails email address validation.','Your SparkPost account region is incorrect.'=>'Your SparkPost account region is incorrect.','Your SparkPost API key is missing the "Transmissions: Read/Write" permission.'=>'Your SparkPost API key is missing the "Transmissions: Read/Write" permission.','Your SparkPost API key is incorrect.'=>'Your SparkPost API key is incorrect.','If you cannot edit php.ini yourself, share the Error Log below with your hosting support and ask them to make this change.'=>'If you cannot edit php.ini yourself, share the Error Log below with your hosting support and ask them to make this change.','(Or) Enable allow_url_fopen by adding allow_url_fopen = On to php.ini.'=>'(Or) Enable allow_url_fopen by adding allow_url_fopen = On to php.ini.','(Recommended) Enable the cURL PHP extension by adding extension=curl to php.ini.'=>'(Recommended) Enable the cURL PHP extension by adding extension=curl to php.ini.','The allow_url_fopen PHP setting is disabled on your server.'=>'The allow_url_fopen PHP setting is disabled on your server.','The cURL PHP extension is disabled on your server.'=>'The cURL PHP extension is disabled on your server.','Your SMTP.com Sender Name is incorrect.'=>'Your SMTP.com Sender Name is incorrect.','In Google Cloud Console, re-enable the disabled OAuth client, or create a new OAuth client and update the plugin settings with the new Client ID/Secret.'=>'In Google Cloud Console, re-enable the disabled OAuth client, or create a new OAuth client and update the plugin settings with the new Client ID/Secret.','Make sure your Client ID/Secret corresponds to a project that has the Gmail API enabled.'=>'Make sure your Client ID/Secret corresponds to a project that has the Gmail API enabled.','Your Google OAuth client has been disabled.'=>'Your Google OAuth client has been disabled.','Follow our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gmail tutorial</a> to ensure your project and credentials are configured correctly.'=>'Follow our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gmail tutorial</a> to ensure your project and credentials are configured correctly.','Make sure the Client ID/Secret in your settings corresponds to a project that has the Gmail API enabled.'=>'Make sure the Client ID/Secret in your settings corresponds to a project that has the Gmail API enabled.','The Gmail API is not enabled on the project.'=>'The Gmail API is not enabled on the project.','The Google Cloud project linked to your Client ID/Secret no longer exists.'=>'The Google Cloud project linked to your Client ID/Secret no longer exists.','Enable the Gmail API in your project from <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Cloud Console</a>.'=>'Enable the Gmail API in your project from <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Cloud Console</a>.','In the Apps list of <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Workspace Admin</a>, confirm that Gmail is enabled.'=>'In the Apps list of <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Workspace Admin</a>, confirm that Gmail is enabled.','Verify in <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Workspace Admin</a> that your trial period has not expired.'=>'Verify in <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Workspace Admin</a> that your trial period has not expired.','The Gmail API is not enabled in your Google Cloud project.'=>'The Gmail API is not enabled in your Google Cloud project.','Gmail is not enabled in your Google Workspace account.'=>'Gmail is not enabled in your Google Workspace account.','Your Google Workspace trial period has expired.'=>'Your Google Workspace trial period has expired.','Make sure there is no aggressive caching on admin pages, or clear the cache between attempts.'=>'Make sure there is no aggressive caching on admin pages, or clear the cache between attempts.','Do not manually clean up the plugin options to retry the "Allow..." step.'=>'Do not manually clean up the plugin options to retry the "Allow..." step.','Then click the "Allow plugin to send emails using your Google account" button and re-enable access.'=>'Then click the "Allow plugin to send emails using your Google account" button and re-enable access.','Go to the WP Mail SMTP plugin Settings page and click the "Remove OAuth Connection" button.'=>'Go to the WP Mail SMTP plugin Settings page and click the "Remove OAuth Connection" button.','Access was revoked from your Google account.'=>'Access was revoked from your Google account.','Your Gmail OAuth refresh token has expired.'=>'Your Gmail OAuth refresh token has expired.','If you are generating the email yourself, make sure it includes a TO header.'=>'If you are generating the email yourself, make sure it includes a TO header.','It should look like %1$s. These are invalid: %2$s.'=>'It should look like %1$s. These are invalid: %2$s.','Check the "Send To" email address and confirm it is valid and not empty.'=>'Check the "Send To" email address and confirm it is valid and not empty.','The recipient email address is empty or invalid.'=>'The recipient email address is empty or invalid.','Click the "Allow plugin to send emails using your Google account" button.'=>'Click the "Allow plugin to send emails using your Google account" button.','Your Mailgun account is still on the free trial plan.'=>'Your Mailgun account is still on the free trial plan.','Your Mailgun domain has not been verified.'=>'Your Mailgun domain has not been verified.','Your Mailgun region is incorrect.'=>'Your Mailgun region is incorrect.','Your Mailgun domain name is incorrect.'=>'Your Mailgun domain name is incorrect.','Your Mailgun API key is incorrect.'=>'Your Mailgun API key is incorrect.','If you do not see the activation email, go to your Mailgun control panel and resend it.'=>'If you do not see the activation email, go to your Mailgun control panel and resend it.','Your Mailgun account has not been activated.'=>'Your Mailgun account has not been activated.','Triple-check your SMTP settings: host, email, password, port, and security.'=>'Triple-check your SMTP settings: host, email, password, port, and security.','Your web server is blocking the outbound connection.'=>'Your web server is blocking the outbound connection.','Contact your hosting support and share the Error Log below along with this <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">link</a>.'=>'Contact your hosting support and share the Error Log below along with this <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">link</a>.','Your server\'s OpenSSL CA bundle is outdated.'=>'Your server\'s OpenSSL CA bundle is outdated.','The SMTP host\'s SSL certificate is misconfigured or expired.'=>'The SMTP host\'s SSL certificate is misconfigured or expired.','Enable Authentication.'=>'Enable Authentication.','Your SMTP host requires authentication, but it is disabled in the plugin settings.'=>'Your SMTP host requires authentication, but it is disab