ecommended). In some cases, due to server misconfigurations, this can cause issues and may need to be disabled.'=>'By default, TLS encryption is automatically used if the server supports it (recommended). In some cases, due to server misconfigurations, this can cause issues and may need to be disabled.','Auto TLS'=>'Auto TLS','For most servers TLS is the recommended option. If your SMTP provider offers both SSL and TLS options, we recommend using TLS.'=>'For most servers TLS is the recommended option. If your SMTP provider offers both SSL and TLS options, we recommend using TLS.','TLS'=>'TLS','SSL'=>'SSL','None'=>'None','<a href="%s" rel="" target="_blank">More information</a> on Mailgun.com.'=>'<a href="%s" rel="" target="_blank">More information</a> on Mailgun.com.','If you are operating under EU laws, you may be required to use EU region.'=>'If you are operating under EU laws, you may be required to use EU region.','Define which endpoint you want to use for sending messages.'=>'Define which endpoint you want to use for sending messages.','EU'=>'EU','US'=>'US','Region'=>'Region','Get a Domain Name'=>'Get a Domain Name','Follow this link to get a Domain Name from Mailgun: %s.'=>'Follow this link to get a Domain Name from Mailgun: %s.','Domain Name'=>'Domain Name','Private API Key'=>'Private API Key','Mailgun'=>'Mailgun','Default (none)'=>'Default (none)','To send emails you will need only a %s access level for this API key.'=>'To send emails you will need only a %s access level for this API key.','Create API Key'=>'Create API Key','Follow this link to get an API Key from SendGrid: %s.'=>'Follow this link to get an API Key from SendGrid: %s.','API Key'=>'API Key','SendGrid'=>'SendGrid','Other SMTP'=>'Other SMTP','Heads up! WP Mail SMTP has detected %1$s is activated. Please deactivate %1$s to prevent conflicts.'=>'Heads up! WP Mail SMTP has detected %1$s is activated. Please deactivate %1$s to prevent conflicts.','Activated'=>'Activated','Install'=>'Install','Status'=>'Status','Version'=>'Version','Type'=>'Type','Source'=>'Source','Active'=>'Active','Not Installed'=>'Not Installed','Recommended'=>'Recommended','Dismiss this notice'=>'Dismiss this notice','Install Plugin'=>'Install Plugin','Please rate <strong>WP Mail SMTP</strong> <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</a> on <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WordPress.org</a> to help us spread the word. Thank you from the WP Mail SMTP team!'=>'Please rate <strong>WP Mail SMTP</strong> <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</a> on <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WordPress.org</a> to help us spread the word. Thank you from the WP Mail SMTP team!','Thanks for using WP Mail SMTP! To complete the plugin setup and start sending emails, <strong>please select and configure your <a href="%s">Mailer</a></strong>.'=>'Thanks for using WP Mail SMTP! To complete the plugin setup and start sending emails, <strong>please select and configure your <a href="%s">Mailer</a></strong>.','You have successfully linked the current site with your Zoho Mail API project. Now you can start sending emails through Zoho Mail.'=>'You have successfully linked the current site with your Zoho Mail API project. Now you can start sending emails through Zoho Mail.','There was an error while processing the authentication request. Please make sure that you have Client ID and Client Secret both valid and saved.'=>'There was an error while processing the authentication request. Please make sure that you have Client ID and Client Secret both valid and saved.','There was an error while processing the authentication request. Please try again.'=>'There was an error while processing the authentication request. Please try again.','There was an error while processing the authentication request: %s. Please try again.'=>'There was an error while processing the authentication request: %s. Please try again.','If unchecked, bounce messages may be lost.'=>'If unchecked, bounce messages may be lost.','If checked, the From Name setting above will be used for all emails, ignoring values set by other plugins.'=>'If checked, the From Name setting above will be used for all emails, ignoring values set by other plugins.','Force From Name'=>'Force From Name','The name that emails are sent from.'=>'The name that emails are sent from.','If checked, the From Email setting above will be used for all emails, ignoring values set by other plugins.'=>'If checked, the From Email setting above will be used for all emails, ignoring values set by other plugins.','Force From Email'=>'Force From Email','Please note that other plugins can change this, to prevent this use the setting below.'=>'Please note that other plugins can change this, to prevent this use the setting below.','If you\'re using an email provider (Yahoo, Outlook.com, etc) this should be your email address for that account.'=>'If you\'re using an email provider (Yahoo, Outlook.com, etc) this should be your email address for that account.','The email address that emails are sent from.'=>'The email address that emails are sent from.','Your host is rejecting the connection.'=>'Your host is rejecting the connection.','An issue was detected.'=>'An issue was detected.','Google API Error.'=>'Google API Error.','Complete the steps in section "2. Verify Your Domain".'=>'Complete the steps in section "2. Verify Your Domain".','Go to our how-to guide for setting up <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mailgun with WP Mail SMTP</a>.'=>'Go to our how-to guide for setting up <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mailgun with WP Mail SMTP</a>.','Mailgun failed.'=>'Mailgun failed.','Your SMTP host is rejecting the connection.'=>'Your SMTP host is rejecting the connection.','Your web server is blocking the connection.'=>'Your web server is blocking the connection.','Typically this error is returned for one of the following reasons:'=>'Typically this error is returned for one of the following reasons:','Could not connect to the SMTP host.'=>'Could not connect to the SMTP host.','Enable Authentication'=>'Enable Authentication','Unauthenticated senders are not allowed.'=>'Unauthenticated senders are not allowed.','Error due to unsolicited and/or bulk e-mail.'=>'Error due to unsolicited and/or bulk e-mail.','Verify with your SMTP host that your account has permissions to send emails using outside connections.'=>'Verify with your SMTP host that your account has permissions to send emails using outside connections.','Contact your SMTP host to confirm you are using the correct username and password.'=>'Contact your SMTP host to confirm you are using the correct username and password.','Could not authenticate your SMTP account.'=>'Could not authenticate your SMTP account.','Contact your web hosting provider and inform them you are having issues making outbound connections.'=>'Contact your web hosting provider and inform them you are having issues making outbound connections.','Could not connect to your host.'=>'Could not connect to your host.','Could not connect to host.'=>'Could not connect to host.','Contact your web hosting provider and inform them your site has an issue with SSL certificates.'=>'Contact your web hosting provider and inform them your site has an issue with SSL certificates.','SSL certificate issue.'=>'SSL certificate issue.','Test email to %s'=>'Test email to %s','Test failed. Please use a valid email address and try to resend the test email.'=>'Test failed. Please use a valid email address and try to resend the test email.','Send Email'=>'Send Email','You cannot send an email. Mailer is not properly configured. Please check your settings.'=>'You cannot send an email. Mailer is not properly configured. Please check your settings.','Send this email in HTML or in plain text format.'=>'Send this email in HTML or in plain text format.','Off'=>'Off','On'=>'On','HTML'=>'HTML','Send To'=>'Send To','Email Test'=>'Email Test','Settings were successfully saved.'=>'Settings were successfully saved.','Save Settings'=>'Save Settings','Uninstall WP Mail SMTP'=>'Uninstall WP Mail SMTP','Test emails are allowed to be sent, regardless of this option.'=>'Test emails are allowed to be sent, regardless of this option.','You will need to consult with their documentation to switch them to use default WordPress email delivery.'=>'You will need to consult with their documentation to switch them to use default WordPress email delivery.','Some plugins, like BuddyPress and Events Manager, are using their own email delivery solutions. By default, this option does not block their emails, as those plugins do not use default <code>wp_mail()</code> function to send emails.'=>'Some plugins, like BuddyPress and Events Manager, are using their own email delivery solutions. By default, this option does not block their emails, as those plugins do not use default <code>wp_mail()</code> function to send emails.','Do Not Send'=>'Do Not Send','General'=>'General','Misc'=>'Misc','Contact your web hosting provider and ask them to verify your server can make outside connections, and whether a firewall or security policy may be blocking them. Many shared hosts block certain ports. <strong>Note: this is the most common cause of this issue.</strong>'=>'Contact your web hosting provider and ask them to verify your server can make outside connections, and whether a firewall or security policy may be blocking them. Many shared hosts block certain ports. <strong>Note: this is the most common cause of this issue.</strong>','Contact your SMTP host to ask about sending and rate limits.'=>'Contact your SMTP host to ask about sending and rate limits.','Contact your web hosting provider and ask them to verify your server can connect to your SMTP host on the configured port and encryption, and whether a firewall or security policy may be blocking the connection. Many shared hosts block certain ports. <strong>Note: this is the most common cause of this issue.</strong>'=>'Contact your web hosting provider and ask them to verify your server can connect to your SMTP host on the configured port and encryption, and whether a firewall or security policy may be blocking the connection. Many shared hosts block certain ports. <strong>Note: this is the most common cause of this issue.</strong>','Enter the correct SMTP Username (usually an email address) and Password in the appropriate fields.'=>'Enter the correct SMTP Username (usually an email address) and Password in the appropriate fields.','Go to the WP Mail SMTP plugin Settings page.'=>'Go to the WP Mail SMTP plugin Settings page.','Reinstall the plugin with clean plugin data enabled on the Misc page. This will remove all plugin options so you can safely retry.'=>'Reinstall the plugin with clean plugin data enabled on the Misc page. This will remove all plugin options so you can safely retry.','Triple-check your SMTP settings including host address, email, and password. If you have recently reset your password you will need to update the settings.'=>'Triple-check your SMTP settings including host address, email, and password. If you have recently reset your password you will need to update the settings.','Verify with them that your SMTP account is in good standing and has not been flagged.'=>'Verify with them that your SMTP account is in good standing and has not been flagged.','Your SMTP settings are incorrect (wrong port, security setting, or host).'=>'Your SMTP settings are incorrect (wrong port, security setting, or host).','Your plugin settings are incorrect (wrong SMTP settings, invalid Mailer configuration, etc.).'=>'Your plugin settings are incorrect (wrong SMTP settings, invalid Mailer configuration, etc.).','Activate %s'=>'Activate %s','Required.'=>'Required.','Mail'=>'Mail','Save Changes'=>'Save Changes','Settings'=>'Settings','Authentication'=>'Authentication','From Email'=>'From Email','From Name'=>'From Name','SMTP Port'=>'SMTP Port','Send a Test Email'=>'Send a Test Email','Encryption'=>'Encryption','SMTP Host'=>'SMTP Host','Return Path'=>'Return Path','Mailer'=>'Mailer','WP Mail SMTP'=>'WP Mail SMTP','Email'=>'Email']];